;; Diagnostic corpus positive control: a program with NO diagnosable defect
;; must compile and run cleanly. This is the counterpart to the "diagnosed
;; program must not build and run" contract -- a fixture that is not
;; diagnosed must be allowed to build AND run, so the corpus runner cannot
;; pass by rejecting everything indiscriminately.

(display "diagnostic-corpus-control-ok")
(newline)
